INSERT INTO `shift_notes` (`id`, `shift_id`, `note_type`, `note_body`, `keep_private`, `mileage`, `attachments`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `user_id`, `title`, `client_id`, `staff_note`) VALUES
(16, NULL, 'Enquiry', '<p>asalkjakldnad</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"01K8XB711KSHENR5JFWFBJXW3R.webp\"},{\"file_path\":\"01K8XB711PVHCZGMY65B14JMX7.webp\"}]', '2025-10-31 21:37:14', '2025-10-31 21:37:14', 1, 'Mollitia rerum sint ', 3, 0),
(17, NULL, 'Feedback', '<p>Julie was on her bed on my arrival. Julie didn\'t sleep good. She had pain and feeling hot and cold. Julie BP was hot stable around 01:00 am. Around 03:00 am BP Stabled. Julie request to roll to her sides around 05:00 am. Massaged on legs and hips. Julie complaint about headaches. Tense machine used 3x times. Catheter total 1900ml out. Josie\'s med given at 06:00 am. All Night duties done. Hand over given to the morning staff. End Shift at 07:00 am.</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8XBRAWACTAFG26P7RYATAHW.csv\"}]', '2025-10-31 21:46:41', '2025-10-31 21:46:41', 1, 'Ahmed Mustajab Shah added a Note for Julie Bridge @ 17/10/2025 10:00 pm - 07:00 am', 3, 0),
(18, NULL, 'Injury', '<p>Saturday , 18/10/2025, 10:00 PM - 07:00 AM<br>Julie was on her bed on my arrival. She didn\'t sleep good. She had pain in left shoulder. She also had pain in belly and hips as well. Massaged on hips and belly. Roll hips and belly used Dome on Legs , belly and chest. Catheter Total out 1200ml. 2x times tense machine on hips. All Night duties done. Hand over given to the morning staff. End Shift at 07:00 am.</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8XBVMYYWCJC1HQXTK0PMS5S.jpg\"}]', '2025-10-31 21:48:30', '2025-10-31 21:48:30', 1, 'Ahmed Mustajab Shah added a Note fo', 3, 0),
(20, NULL, 'Incident', '<p>. She had pain in shoulder and and lower back for 45 minutes. Massaged on legs and hips with spike ball. Catheter total out 1500ml. Massaged on legs with hands. Toes and Fingers straight.&nbsp;</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8XCPNEH51G12HZXZ1HDQDKT.jpg\"}]', '2025-10-31 22:03:15', '2025-10-31 22:03:15', 1, ' added a Note for Julie Bridge', 3, 0),
(21, NULL, 'Feedback', '<p>It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout. The point of using Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters,</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8XFH8QST0XXMWX2AFZXJF21.docx\"}]', '2025-10-31 22:52:44', '2025-10-31 22:52:44', 1, 'Friday , 17/10/2025, 10:00 PM - 07:00 AM', 1, 0),
(22, NULL, 'Feedback', '<p>It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable content of a page when looking at its layout. The point of using Lorem Ipsum is that it has a more-or-less normal distribution of letters,</p>', 0, NULL, NULL, '2025-11-01 10:47:38', '2025-11-01 10:47:38', 1, 'Admin add a note', NULL, 1),
(24, NULL, 'Enquiry', '<p>&nbsp;Sure! Since you want to <strong>remove the shift relation entirely</strong>, you can just remove the with(\'shift\') call. Also, your current client_id check uses $this-&gt;staffId, which seems intentional, so I’ll leave it. Here’s the cleaned-up version:&nbsp;</p>', 1, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8ZJKH96TAM4ZF1WRS37S54N.docx\"}]', '2025-11-01 18:24:53', '2025-11-01 18:24:53', 27, NULL, NULL, 1),
(25, NULL, 'Progress Notes', '<p>Got it! You want to <strong>keep all existing filters and client-based queries</strong>, but <strong>also include staff notes</strong> (where client_id is null, user_id is the logged-in user, and staff_note is true).</p><p>Here’s the updated getClientNotes() method:</p>', 0, NULL, '[{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8ZJPTJ42XY6RBEV3EYTGC9K.csv\"},{\"file_path\":\"shift_notes\\/01K8ZJPTJ73HTRHDYHEV5VCR3W.csv\"}]', '2025-11-01 18:26:41', '2025-11-01 18:26:41', 27, NULL, NULL, 1),
(26, NULL, 'Progress Notes', '<p><strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.</p>', 0, NULL, '[]', '2025-11-01 19:52:18', '2025-11-01 19:52:18', 31, NULL, NULL, 1);
